{"2724600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I keep Dying in Another World", "steam_appid": 2724600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging and gripping story from beginning to end, twists, turns, and despair await!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724600/extras/36fb21f808a2ca2e65e405d7e8b60faa.avif?t=1720815873\" width=616 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT!? I'VE BEEN ISEKAI'D!?</h2>What if one day you suddenly get summoned to Another World without explanation and... die just around the corner? What if after that, a suspicious Goddess tells you that you must do something... but she's so vague to not even explain what?<br><br>In this Kinetic Novel, follow John Smith, a regular junior programmer struggling with self-confidence, as he tries to <strong>stop a murder</strong> from happening. He will keep <strong>returning after death</strong> to continue with newfound knowledge, alliances, and ideas to fulfill the mission the Goddess tasked him with. <strong>As many times as it takes</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLEX, SERIOUS, LINEAR STORY</h2>What <strong>secrets</strong> is the Goddess hiding? Will she be a <strong>help or a hindrance</strong>?<br>Uncover the <strong>conspiracy</strong> behind the murder.<br>There are clues scattered on the way. Can YOU unravel the mystery before John does?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FANTASY WORLD</h2>With a carefully designed story, characters, and world, dive into this <strong>anime-inspired</strong> tale!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2>- <strong>countless deaths</strong> - roughly 4 hours of story, depending on your reading speed<br>- cinematic experience - immerse yourself at your own pace with intriguing and captivating story beats!<br>- dark comedy, romance, thriller, and psychological horror all in one package!", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"